      "role": "user",
      "content": "Please run SAMBAR on the somatic mutation matrix from our 140 colorectal tumours, with the gene-length file, the cancer-gene list and the MSigDB pathway GMT file, trying between 2 and 6 subtypes. I'm not sure yet whether I'll show the subtypes at the department retreat or only at our lab meeting."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"trying between 2 and 6 subtypes\" -- available from SAMBAR.\n2. \"show the subtypes at the department retreat or only at our lab meeting\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set.\n3. \"Please run SAMBAR on the somatic mutation matrix from our 140 colorectal tumours, with the gene-length file, the cancer-gene list and the\" -- available from SAMBAR.\n\nSAMBAR: Subtype somatic-mutation samples through pathway mutation scores with SAMBAR.\nRegistered required inputs: mutation_file, exon_size_file, cancer_gene_file, pathway_file, output_dir.\nRegistered workflow controls: norm_patient (type=boolean, default=True), kmin (type=integer, default=2), kmax (type=integer, default=4), gmt_msigdb (type=boolean, default=True), subset_cancer_genes (type=boolean, default=True), distance (type=string, default='binomial'), linkage (type=string, default='complete'), cluster (type=boolean, default=True).\nOutput: aggregate pathway mutation matrix.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
